# Driver ABI goal

The goal is that a driver built with the Windows 10 22H2 WDK loads and its calls into `ntoskrnl`, the HAL, and KMDF return instead of bugchecking.

- Judge a change by whether that driver still calls the same exports.
- Do not "fix" a failure by changing the calling convention, structure layout, or IRQL behavior a WDK driver already uses.
- User-mode syscall compatibility is part of the ABI. Applications and graphics stay visible, and they are not the headline score.
